      <rules>
        <rule id="abca-c380-0d2e-524d" name="Development and composition checks" hidden="false">
          <description>Alpha catalogue. Percentage checks remain provisional: verify categories against the agreed battle limit and avoid double-counting nested champion points. Special Characters remain part of the Characters allowance. Band division, Banshee allowances, profile conflicts and other exceptions are documented in COVERAGE.md.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="52dd-6048-76d4-fa67" name="Where to find special characters" hidden="false">
          <description>Dieter Helsnicht — Special Characters; Heinrich Kemmler, the Lichemaster — Special Characters; Krell — Special Characters; Mannfred von Carstein — Special Characters; Melkhior the Ancient — Special Characters; Neferata, Queen of Mysteries — Special Characters; Vlad von Carstein — Special Characters; Isabella von Carstein — Special Characters; Walach Harkon — Special Characters.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="f744-c2b8-5a98-60b1" name="Special Characters allowance" hidden="false">
          <description>The Special Characters section is for organisation only. These selections still count against the normal Characters allowance; there is no additional points allowance. Named unit champions remain inside their eligible unit’s Models group.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
