                  <rules>
                    <rule id="9287-fcfc-ae37-9ad0" name="Wolf Form" hidden="false">
                      <description>On foot, use Move 9 for normal movement, including marches; does not change charge, flee or pursuit distance. Reference: Vampire Counts p. 27.</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry id="1ca5-d9f5-4cca-b271" name="Honour or Death" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" publicationId="c115-e636-a63a-a216" page="27">
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="pts" typeId="0044-15f1-782b-00ea" value="10" />
                  </costs>
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="5b90-31e8-4ec2-8de6" type="max" value="1" scope="parent" field="selections" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
                  </constraints>
                  <rules>
                    <rule id="cee2-0f56-892d-4709" name="Honour or Death" hidden="false">
                      <description>Must accept enemy challenges. Before the challengers move together, the enemy character tests basic Leadership with no modifiers. A psychology-immune character ignores this. On failure the enemy hides in the rear, no challenge is fought, and the Vampire fights ordinary opponents in contact. Reference: Vampire Counts p. 27.</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry id="effb-bbe6-bcde-5ad3" name="Unbending Willpower" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" publicationId="c115-e636-a63a-a216" page="27">
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="pts" typeId="0044-15f1-782b-00ea" value="10" />
                  </costs>
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="f487-1b54-a430-ec15" type="max" value="1" scope="parent" field="selections" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
                  </constraints>
                  <rules>
                    <rule id="8b8d-dcdb-450f-8fac" name="Unbending Willpower" hidden="false">
                      <description>An Undead unit led by this Vampire suffers one fewer crumbling wound from losing combat. If the General dies, its D6 loss becomes D6−1. Reference: Vampire Counts p. 27.</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry id="3352-eb91-1c31-ad75" name="Transfix" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" publicationId="c115-e636-a63a-a216" page="27">
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="pts" typeId="0044-15f1-782b-00ea" value="20" />
                  </costs>
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="41e6-f0cd-3dbb-6b24" type="max" value="1" scope="parent" field="selections" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
                  </constraints>
                  <rules>
                    <rule id="b00e-fdbe-36b4-a8ee" name="Transfix" hidden="false">
                      <description>At the start of melee choose one enemy in base contact. It tests basic Leadership, without modifiers; on failure it cannot attack and attacks against it hit automatically. Psychology-immune models are unaffected. Reference: Vampire Counts p. 27.</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry id="6dcd-f818-5909-c48d" name="Summon Wolves" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" publicationId="c115-e636-a63a-a216" page="27">
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="pts" typeId="0044-15f1-782b-00ea" value="30" />
                  </costs>
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="607c-c3f3-2821-9c66" type="max" value="1" scope="parent" field="selections" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
                  </constraints>
                  <rules>
                    <rule id="2e98-b46a-5228-3b7d" name="Summon Wolves" hidden="false">
                      <description>Summon D3+1 Dire Wolves. One use at the start of your turn. Random edge: 1 your edge, 2–3 left, 4–5 right, 6 enemy edge. Place centrally on that edge; the arrivals may move but not charge that turn. Reference: Vampire Counts p. 27.</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry id="c24d-4c7d-ecc4-677f" name="Bat Form" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" publicationId="c115-e636-a63a-a216" page="27">
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="pts" typeId="0044-15f1-782b-00ea" value="40" />
                  </costs>
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="e473-967e-24c8-651d" type="max" value="1" scope="parent" field="selections" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
                  </constraints>
                  <rules>
                    <rule id="c01e-8a4b-690b-5299" name="Bat Form" hidden="false">
                      <description>On foot, move up to 24 inches ignoring intervening terrain during normal movement; this does not change charge, flee or pursuit movement. Reference: Vampire Counts p. 27.</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </selectionEntry>
              </selectionEntries>
            </selectionEntryGroup>
            <selectionEntryGroup id="85e0-51d3-aa8e-a6be" name="Necrarch" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="4903-c2a9-a31d-502a" type="max" value="0" scope="parent" field="selections" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
              </constraints>
              <modifiers>
                <modifier type="set" field="4903-c2a9-a31d-502a" value="1">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition type="atLeast" field="selections" scope="roster" value="1" childId="b19a-d86d-7a8a-76f6" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" percentValue="false" />
                  </conditions>
                </modifier>
              </modifiers>
              <selectionEntries>
                <selectionEntry id="c6fc-fc1c-9b61-b148" name="Dark Acolyte" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" publicationId="c115-e636-a63a-a216" page="28">
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="pts" typeId="0044-15f1-782b-00ea" value="5" />
                  </costs>
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="c7a1-4b64-eeab-bdb7" type="max" value="1" scope="parent" field="selections" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
                  </constraints>
                  <rules>
                    <rule id="9bfb-10c4-08bd-c592" name="Dark Acolyte" hidden="false">
                      <description>May carry a Dispel Magic Scroll and retain one magic card between phases. This alone does not make a Thrall a wizard. Reference: Vampire Counts p. 28.</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry id="18d9-9f84-a7b3-c9ce" name="Unbending Willpower" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" publicationId="c115-e636-a63a-a216" page="28">
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="pts" typeId="0044-15f1-782b-00ea" value="10" />
                  </costs>
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="d7ee-d3c7-6299-1286" type="max" value="1" scope="parent" field="selections" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
                  </constraints>
                  <rules>
                    <rule id="a283-19ee-11b0-c579" name="Unbending Willpower" hidden="false">
                      <description>Reduce combat-loss crumbling by one for this Vampire or the Undead unit he leads. Its loss on the General's death becomes D6−1. Reference: Vampire Counts p. 28.</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry id="7769-2cdd-3407-18c7" name="The Awakening" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" publicationId="c115-e636-a63a-a216" page="28">
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="pts" typeId="0044-15f1-782b-00ea" value="20" />
                  </costs>
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="075f-7e42-6138-0349" type="max" value="1" scope="parent" field="selections" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
                  </constraints>
                  <rules>
                    <rule id="096f-d763-2eba-106e" name="The Awakening" hidden="false">
                      <description>Add D3 raised models when casting Summon Skeletons, Raise the Dead or Summon Undead Horde. Reference: Vampire Counts p. 28.</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry id="5118-6588-6b98-b2ab" name="Master of the Black Arts" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" publicationId="c115-e636-a63a-a216" page="28">
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="pts" typeId="0044-15f1-782b-00ea" value="25" />
                  </costs>
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="4099-d303-27b6-efcb" type="max" value="1" scope="parent" field="selections" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
                  </constraints>
                  <rules>
                    <rule id="f898-78d4-921f-2df3" name="Master of the Black Arts" hidden="false">
                      <description>Add one to rolls to recast Necromantic spells. Reference: Vampire Counts p. 28.</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry id="935a-7380-3dec-04a8" name="Supernatural Horror" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" publicationId="c115-e636-a63a-a216" page="28">
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="pts" typeId="0044-15f1-782b-00ea" value="30" />
                  </costs>
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="64f8-5ef6-05bd-6ae3" type="max" value="1" scope="parent" field="selections" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
                  </constraints>
                  <rules>
                    <rule id="523b-a076-3756-77d6" name="Supernatural Horror" hidden="false">
                      <description>Causes terror. Reference: Vampire Counts p. 28.</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry id="3571-14cc-d512-d464" name="Forbidden Lore" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" publicationId="c115-e636-a63a-a216" page="28">
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="pts" typeId="0044-15f1-782b-00ea" value="40" />
                  </costs>
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="10b8-172a-e727-eecd" type="max" value="1" scope="parent" field="selections" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
                  </constraints>
                  <rules>
                    <rule id="29cc-faad-e2b2-82c6" name="Forbidden Lore" hidden="false">
                      <description>Receives one additional spell; magic level is unchanged. Reference: Vampire Counts p. 28.</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry id="7e96-1320-7509-58f9" name="Curse of the Revenant" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" publicationId="c115-e636-a63a-a216" page="28">
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="pts" typeId="0044-15f1-782b-00ea" value="50" />
                  </costs>
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="50ed-dc25-e471-158a" type="max" value="1" scope="parent" field="selections" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
                  </constraints>
                  <rules>
                    <rule id="107c-15a8-e81d-b012" name="Curse of the Revenant" hidden="false">
                      <description>Add one Wound to the profile. Reference: Vampire Counts p. 28.</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </selectionEntry>
              </selectionEntries>
            </selectionEntryGroup>
            <selectionEntryGroup id="3bdf-107f-a61f-64de" name="Blood Dragon" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="fcbd-59b1-bb97-fcf2" type="max" value="0" scope="parent" field="selections" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
              </constraints>
              <modifiers>
                <modifier type="set" field="fcbd-59b1-bb97-fcf2" value="1">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition type="atLeast" field="selections" scope="roster" value="1" childId="2dce-9d08-bbf3-cd0f" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" percentValue="false" />
                  </conditions>
                </modifier>
              </modifiers>
              <selectionEntries>
                <selectionEntry id="99b1-f2a0-5c68-7027" name="Doomrider" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" publicationId="c115-e636-a63a-a216" page="29">
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="pts" typeId="0044-15f1-782b-00ea" value="5" />
                  </costs>
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="4107-3e7a-a652-ce33" type="max" value="1" scope="parent" field="selections" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
                  </constraints>
                  <rules>
                    <rule id="60ea-67bd-def1-90f2" name="Doomrider" hidden="false">
                      <description>A ridden Nightmare ignores movement penalties from armour and barding. Reference: Vampire Counts p. 29.</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry id="6274-0b20-545f-bc0d" name="Honour or Death" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" publicationId="c115-e636-a63a-a216" page="29">
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="pts" typeId="0044-15f1-782b-00ea" value="10" />
                  </costs>
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="9a18-b608-1bd4-c30d" type="max" value="1" scope="parent" field="selections" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
                  </constraints>
                  <rules>
                    <rule id="7f10-791b-66ea-0627" name="Honour or Death" hidden="false">
                      <description>Must accept enemy challenges. Before the challengers move together, the enemy character tests basic Leadership with no modifiers. A psychology-immune character ignores this. On failure the enemy hides in the rear, no challenge is fought, and the Vampire fights ordinary opponents in contact. Reference: Vampire Counts p. 29.</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry id="aa62-56fe-fa2d-c8e1" name="Might of Arms" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" publicationId="c115-e636-a63a-a216" page="29">
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="pts" typeId="0044-15f1-782b-00ea" value="10" />
                  </costs>
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="4609-7b87-8da9-21da" type="max" value="1" scope="parent" field="selections" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
                  </constraints>
                  <rules>
                    <rule id="05d9-14c2-caf1-fdc9" name="Might of Arms" hidden="false">
                      <description>Add one Weapon Skill. Reference: Vampire Counts p. 29.</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry id="a2b5-32fe-7d78-2de9" name="Strength of Steel" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" publicationId="c115-e636-a63a-a216" page="29">
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="pts" typeId="0044-15f1-782b-00ea" value="10" />
                  </costs>
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="6524-7e4b-5445-7c2f" type="max" value="1" scope="parent" field="selections" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
                  </constraints>
                  <rules>
                    <rule id="8131-28e9-bb62-6630" name="Strength of Steel" hidden="false">
                      <description>May cast spells while wearing normal armour. Reference: Vampire Counts p. 29.</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry id="9fc9-4178-0792-7fcb" name="Blademaster" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" publicationId="c115-e636-a63a-a216" page="29">
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="pts" typeId="0044-15f1-782b-00ea" value="20" />
                  </costs>
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="ecd9-e922-ccb9-298d" type="max" value="1" scope="parent" field="selections" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
                  </constraints>
                  <rules>
                    <rule id="eb7b-3d30-59c0-8650" name="Blademaster" hidden="false">
                      <description>Choose one enemy in base contact to lose one Attack. For mixed attacks choose which kind is lost, including a mount attack or bite. Reference: Vampire Counts p. 29.</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry id="2e6d-abb5-062e-ed4f" name="Warrior Pride" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" publicationId="c115-e636-a63a-a216" page="29">
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="pts" typeId="0044-15f1-782b-00ea" value="20" />
                  </costs>
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="eb5e-6fbf-f636-a35d" type="max" value="1" scope="parent" field="selections" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
                  </constraints>
                  <rules>
                    <rule id="d1f1-a452-becf-0317" name="Warrior Pride" hidden="false">
                      <description>May cast spells while wearing normal or magical armour. Reference: Vampire Counts p. 29.</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry id="cea6-e9d0-4d78-18d3" name="Red Fury" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" publicationId="c115-e636-a63a-a216" page="29">
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="pts" typeId="0044-15f1-782b-00ea" value="25" />
                  </costs>
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="a418-27c2-34d0-6b8f" type="max" value="1" scope="parent" field="selections" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
                  </constraints>
                  <rules>
                    <rule id="8ee5-368d-93ae-b5ed" name="Red Fury" hidden="false">
                      <description>Add one Attack. Reference: Vampire Counts p. 29.</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </selectionEntry>
              </selectionEntries>
            </selectionEntryGroup>
            <selectionEntryGroup id="0d77-2bc6-2182-c520" name="Lahmia" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="84d0-bedb-f14a-99d7" type="max" value="0" scope="parent" field="selections" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
              </constraints>
              <modifiers>
                <modifier type="set" field="84d0-bedb-f14a-99d7" value="1">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition type="atLeast" field="selections" scope="roster" value="1" childId="261a-1963-87e7-5228" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" percentValue="false" />
                  </conditions>
                </modifier>
              </modifiers>
              <selectionEntries>
                <selectionEntry id="1eb1-f74d-01f2-bd71" name="Lightning Reflexes" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" publicationId="c115-e636-a63a-a216" page="30">
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="pts" typeId="0044-15f1-782b-00ea" value="5" />
                  </costs>
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="c2d8-7f76-8230-05a4" type="max" value="1" scope="parent" field="selections" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
                  </constraints>
                  <rules>
                    <rule id="49f1-a859-89ae-eece" name="Lightning Reflexes" hidden="false">
                      <description>Initiative becomes 10. Reference: Vampire Counts p. 30.</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry id="702d-6ef1-784d-d10d" name="The Dead Walk Fast" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" publicationId="c115-e636-a63a-a216" page="30">
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="pts" typeId="0044-15f1-782b-00ea" value="5" />
                  </costs>
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="4ee3-d8c8-c5b9-e53f" type="max" value="1" scope="parent" field="selections" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
                  </constraints>
                  <rules>
                    <rule id="9c17-6077-75bd-c2b5" name="The Dead Walk Fast" hidden="false">
                      <description>Add one Move. Reference: Vampire Counts p. 30.</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry id="f636-756f-3f12-6151" name="Swiftness" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" publicationId="c115-e636-a63a-a216" page="30">
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="pts" typeId="0044-15f1-782b-00ea" value="10" />
                  </costs>
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="2ee2-7228-4844-7990" type="max" value="1" scope="parent" field="selections" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
                  </constraints>
                  <rules>
                    <rule id="73e0-6851-90f1-db5a" name="Swiftness" hidden="false">
                      <description>On foot and alone, may march even with enemies within eight inches. Reference: Vampire Counts p. 30.</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry id="5739-7a5d-ea06-f2f4" name="Transfix" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" publicationId="c115-e636-a63a-a216" page="30">
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="pts" typeId="0044-15f1-782b-00ea" value="20" />
                  </costs>
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="bc59-3530-97d2-c993" type="max" value="1" scope="parent" field="selections" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
                  </constraints>
                  <rules>
                    <rule id="64c9-97f4-f783-9ae6" name="Transfix" hidden="false">
                      <description>At the start of melee choose one enemy in base contact. It tests basic Leadership, without modifiers; on failure it cannot attack and attacks against it hit automatically. Psychology-immune models are unaffected. Reference: Vampire Counts p. 30.</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry id="3c5f-1c3d-beda-1916" name="Quickblood" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" publicationId="c115-e636-a63a-a216" page="30">
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="pts" typeId="0044-15f1-782b-00ea" value="25" />
                  </costs>
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="fdba-1be9-383d-019d" type="max" value="1" scope="parent" field="selections" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
                  </constraints>
                  <rules>
                    <rule id="d22b-fff8-8847-344e" name="Quickblood" hidden="false">
                      <description>Avoid each wound on 5+ before other saves and before multiplying wounds. Reference: Vampire Counts p. 30.</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry id="03f7-a21a-7012-2a7f" name="Innocence Lost" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" publicationId="c115-e636-a63a-a216" page="30">
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="pts" typeId="0044-15f1-782b-00ea" value="30" />
                  </costs>
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="54ae-e23e-31f6-3e46" type="max" value="1" scope="parent" field="selections" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
                  </constraints>
                  <rules>
                    <rule id="60e9-c554-c74f-5ecb" name="Innocence Lost" hidden="false">
                      <description>Always strikes first; against another first-strike ability use Initiative, then roll off ties. Reference: Vampire Counts p. 30.</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry id="198c-e131-405e-4334" name="Mist Form" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" publicationId="c115-e636-a63a-a216" page="30">
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="pts" typeId="0044-15f1-782b-00ea" value="40" />
                  </costs>
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="0e83-74ae-9682-b129" type="max" value="1" scope="parent" field="selections" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
                  </constraints>
                  <rules>
                    <rule id="dbe6-36e9-be81-9b8a" name="Mist Form" hidden="false">
                      <description>On foot, move up to 24 inches ignoring intervening terrain during normal movement; this does not change charge, flee or pursuit movement. Reference: Vampire Counts p. 30.</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </selectionEntry>
              </selectionEntries>
            </selectionEntryGroup>
          </selectionEntryGroups>
          <rules>
            <rule id="1c09-e7ca-2b11-59ba" name="Power effects" hidden="false">
              <description>Apply profile changes, spell counts, armour exceptions and temporary effects manually. Power costs and family/rank eligibility are encoded; effects do not rewrite the printed profile.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntryGroup>
