        <rule id="2589-2361-3072-5b97" name="Army-list note" hidden="false">
          <description>Profile source conflict: the Nightmare in the army-list p. 64 prints S4/T4; other Nightmare entries use S3/T3. This unit preserves its own army-list profile. Independent champion mounts use their own character entry.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="6724-05fb-6d7f-9eaa" name="Models and command" hidden="false">
          <description>Select troopers plus any command; command replaces a trooper. A standard and musician cost twice an equipped trooper; champions use their own profile and price. Whole-unit options charge each affected model automatically. Independent Wight/Wraith champions buy their own equipment and mount.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
